{"title": "End", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">End</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-LevelInformation\">Level Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Price\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Price\">Price</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Price druid-data-nonempty\">\nFree</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-HazardLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-HazardLevel\">Hazard Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-HazardLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\nD-</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SupportedWeather(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SupportedWeather(s)\">Supported Weather(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SupportedWeather(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nNone</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Technical\">Technical</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorSizeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorSizeMultiplier\">Interior Size Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorSizeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\nN/A</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorsSpawnChances\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorsSpawnChances\">Interiors Spawn Chances</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorsSpawnChances druid-data-nonempty\">\nN/A</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MinimumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MinimumScrap\">Minimum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MinimumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\nN/A</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaximumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaximumScrap\">Maximum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaximumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\nN/A</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SpikeTraps\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SpikeTraps\">Spike Traps</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SpikeTraps druid-data-nonempty\">\nN/A &#8594; N/A</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Turrets\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Turrets\">Turrets</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Turrets druid-data-nonempty\">\nN/A &#8594; N/A</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Landmines\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Landmines\">Landmines</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Landmines druid-data-nonempty\">\nN/A &#8594; N/A</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Entities\">Entities</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Indoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantIndoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nN/A</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Outdoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantOutdoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nN/A</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DaytimePower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DaytimePower\">Daytime Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DaytimePower druid-data-nonempty\">\nN/A</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-ExteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-ExteriorPower\">Exterior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-ExteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\nN/A</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorPower\">Interior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\nN/A</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The End.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Info\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Info\">&gt; Moon Info</span></h2>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\"><b>POPULATION:</b> you?\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></h2>\n<p>End is not a traditional moon and serves as the credits for Wesley's Moons. Time does not pass and landing does not count as a day towards the current deadline, although players will be fired upon returning to orbit when landing here on Day 0. Immediately upon landing, the credits will begin rolling and can not be skipped. Once finished, players can explore around the building and find various hazards and objects from many moons and interiors on display.\n</p><p>When facing away from the back of the ship, players can go into the right hallway to reach an area with the library and electric chair from the <a href=\"/wiki/Rubber_Rooms\" title=\"Rubber Rooms\">Rubber Rooms</a> on display. This area also has five buttons on the wall that will spawn weapons and entities to fight in this area:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Wave 1: Two shovels and two Thumpers.</li>\n<li>Wave 2: Two shovels, one Butler, and one Thumper.</li>\n<li>Wave 3: Two loaded shotguns with the safety off, eight shotgun ammo, one Butler, and four Thumpers.</li>\n<li>Wave 4: Two loaded shotguns with the safety off, eight shotgun ammo, two Butlers, two Nutcrackers, and two Thumpers.</li>\n<li>Wave 5: Two loaded shotguns with the safety off, eight shotgun ammo, one Jester, three Nutcrackers, and two Thumpers.</li></ul>\n<p>Every wave can seemingly be infinitely spawned, so players can freely farm knives, shotguns, and shovels on End.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Progression\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Progression\">&gt; Progression</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\".3E_Unlocked_By\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Unlocked_By\">&gt; Unlocked By</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span> Inserting any destiny item into the destiny item slot before taking off in the abandoned ship on <a href=\"/wiki/Repress\" title=\"Repress\">Repress</a>. A destiny item can be acquired on <a href=\"/wiki/Berunah\" title=\"Berunah\">Berunah</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Carnate\" title=\"Carnate\">Carnate</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Empra\" title=\"Empra\">Empra</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Release\" title=\"Release\">Release</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Utril\" title=\"Utril\">Utril</a>. </span></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\".3E_Unlocks\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Unlocks\">&gt; Unlocks</span></h3>\n<p>This moon does not unlock any other moons.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n</div>", "images": [], "cats": ["Pages_with_DRUID_infoboxes", "Pages_with_spoilers", "Moons"]}